Data

Our World in Data charts in dataset/real-owid (a small sample here, the full set in the release zip)
  Charts and data by Our World in Data, CC BY 4.0, https://ourworldindata.org. Each chart's title, source citation and
  URL are in dataset/real-owid/truth.json. The underlying data comes from the sources named there, and those sources
  can carry their own terms. Check them before you reuse a chart or its numbers.

FRED charts are not included. bench/real/fetch_fred.py downloads them for you. Graphs from FRED, Federal Reserve Bank
of St. Louis.

Development only (not shipped, installed by npm)

chart.js, echarts, plotly.js, vega, vega-lite and vega-themes (BSD, MIT, Apache 2.0 and BSD 3 clause) draw the synthetic
benchmark charts. playwright (Apache 2.0) drives the browser tests. pngjs (MIT) and jpeg-js (BSD) decode images in node.
